  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Having to manually go and show peoples avatar just because its considered \"Very Poor\" is the single most annoying this in this game.\nI get it, its supposed to preserve performance, but to be honest in all the time ive been playing, I've never had mayor performance problems with a lot of \"Poor\" and \"Very Poor\" avatars showing at once...\nWhats the point of finding an avatar that suits you, that you like and are comfortable with, if people are just gonna see a generic Fallback. I think the quest is more capable of a system than you give it credit for.\nPlease give us the option to disable Performance limitations. If i am ok with Playing at 30 FPS, it should be my choice, don't you agree?",
